{"meta": {"prompts": ["Give srv 2 servers, run the model until t=2000, and tell me srv's utilization and the mean latency at done. Keep it short."], "model_file": "projects/examples/mm1.yaml", "sources": {}, "recorded": "2026-11-25", "sdk": "0.2.189", "events": [{"type": "tool", "id": "toolu_01XfzJsuLXptAa5HTk15Jos2", "name": "get_model", "input": {}}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "toolu_01XfzJsuLXptAa5HTk15Jos2", "error": false, "text": "name: mm1\ndescription: Classic M/M/1 queue. Arrival rate 0.8, service rate 1.0, so mean time in system is 1/(1.0-0.8) = 5.\nentities:\n- id: gen\n  type: source\n  params:\n    interarrival: {dist: exp, mean: 1.25}\n  pos: [100, 200]\n- id: srv\n  type: server\n  params:\n    service: {dist: exp, mean: 1.0}\n    servers: 1\n  pos: [300, 200]\n- id: done\n  type: sink\n  pos: [500, 200]\n  params: {}\nconnections:\n- {from: gen.out, to: srv.in}\n- {from: srv.out, to: done.in}\ngroups: []\nscenarios: []\n"}, {"type": "tool", "id": "toolu_01RrQ2ooaJwj6GQRmg8VhrvC", "name": "update_entity", "input": {"id": "srv", "params": {"servers": 2}}}, {"type": "model", "model": {"name": "mm1", "description": "Classic M/M/1 queue. Arrival rate 0.8, service rate 1.0, so mean time in system is 1/(1.0-0.8) = 5.", "entities": [{"id": "gen", "type": "source", "params": {"interarrival": {"dist": "exp", "mean": 1.25}}, "pos": [100, 200]}, {"id": "srv", "type": "server", "params": {"service": {"dist": "exp", "mean": 1.0}, "servers": 2}, "pos": [300, 200]}, {"id": "done", "type": "sink", "pos": [500, 200], "params": {}}], "connections": [{"from": "gen.out", "to": "srv.in"}, {"from": "srv.out", "to": "done.in"}], "groups": [], "scenarios": []}}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "toolu_01RrQ2ooaJwj6GQRmg8VhrvC", "error": false, "text": "updated srv"}, {"type": "tool", "id": "toolu_01VcnFKLV7u5y81SztJJmn4j", "name": "run", "input": {"until": 2000}}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "toolu_01VcnFKLV7u5y81SztJJmn4j", "error": false, "text": "t=2000, 6400 events\ngen (source): emitted=1600\nsrv (server): arrivals=1600, busy avg=0.822, completed=1600, queue avg=0.161, residence mean=1.229 p95=3.55, wait mean=0.2012 p95=1.302, utilization=0.411\ndone (sink): hops mean=2 p95=2, latency mean=1.229 p95=3.55, received=1600"}, {"type": "text", "text": "I set srv to 2 servers and ran the model to t=2000 (one seed):\n\n- **srv utilization:** 0.411 per server. On average 0.82 of the 2 servers were busy.\n- **Mean latency at done:** 1.23 (p95 3.55). With 1 server, theory gives a mean of 5.\n\nThis matches M/M/2 theory: utilization 0.4, mean time in system about 1.19. It's a single seed, so expect some noise."}, {"type": "done", "error": false, "subtype": "success", "turns": 4, "duration_ms": 6655, "cost_usd": 0.0194655}], "final_model": {"name": "mm1", "description": "Classic M/M/1 queue. Arrival rate 0.8, service rate 1.0, so mean time in system is 1/(1.0-0.8) = 5.", "entities": [{"id": "gen", "type": "source", "params": {"interarrival": {"dist": "exp", "mean": 1.25}}, "pos": [100, 200]}, {"id": "srv", "type": "server", "params": {"service": {"dist": "exp", "mean": 1.0}, "servers": 2}, "pos": [300, 200]}, {"id": "done", "type": "sink", "pos": [500, 200], "params": {}}], "connections": [{"from": "gen.out", "to": "srv.in"}, {"from": "srv.out", "to": "done.in"}], "groups": [], "scenarios": []}}}
